<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Full Experiment Results</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix A Full Experiment Results ‣ One Model Is Enough: Native Retrieval Embeddings from LLM Agent Hidden States" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> presents all 12 experimental configurations sorted by Recall@10, with bootstrap 95% confidence intervals for the gap to the baseline.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T5" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A1.T5.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
